  Cmn1=Divisible Room Identity\\One instance per HTML5 panel (not fanned).
  Cmn2=||1Same symbol for Master, A, B, and C.\\\\Parameter Panel_Role:\\
  Cmn3=||20 = Master (all rooms)\\  1 = Room A (typical IP-ID E1)\\  2 =||1
  Cmn4=Room B (typical IP-ID E2)\\  3 = Room C (typical IP-ID E3)\\\\Assign_Override||1
  Cmn5=analog: 0 = use the parameter; 1 / 2 / 3 forces A / B / C\\at runtime.
  Cmn6=||1Other values are ignored. Promote a room panel to master layout\\
  Cmn7=by driving Master_Mode high (Master_Mode_FB follows that, or stays||1
  Cmn8=high when\\the effective role is Master).\\\\Wire Master_Mode_FB||1
  Cmn9=to XPanel digital 13, Room_Assign to analog 10.\\Shared AV/wall||1
  Cmn10=logic stays on Divisible Room Logic v1.0 (one instance).
[END]
